{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-01_beg","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-01","title":"别离之夜","storyCode":"7-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"776011f5e338687057fe0d7a0c802182f3943646dd66e8fa2bf9c1b76a8339c2","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"罗德岛上，博士在将霜星的遗体送入综合生物处理室时，遇到了精英干员——迷迭香，并第一次认识了她。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"6:30 p.m."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"编号00000-00002，接入权限-8。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，欢迎访问罗德岛综合生物处理室，已依据生物数据对您的意图进行判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"另外，系统检测到您的心情不佳。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"少烦我。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}表现出一定的攻击性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请放心，系统不会因此电击你，不用太过顾忌系统对你的检测。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}陷入了沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无论是无声抗议还是不愿进行沟通，我认为这都是一种孤独性精神障碍症的表现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然，请便，系统会平等对待所有人。"}]},{"label":"该怎么样才算是好心情？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好与坏是一种主观判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，本系统集成了几乎所有有记载的精神活动状态，以及各类神经兴奋的激素标准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以你可以认为，本系统的主观判断是无限接近客观事实的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因此，无论Dr.{@nickname}将要采取什么样的行动，系统都能在一定程度上进行模拟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，想做什么就去做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"PRTS具备相应的无害安抚机能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当你采取过激行动时你会立刻昏厥并在3.55个工作时后醒来，这可以保证你的行为向正常标准贴近。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Welcome home, Doctor。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......这里真的能算家吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你是，Dr.{@nickname}？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"啊？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你好？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你，没有错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我感觉到了......虽然，不太一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......你怀里的人，穿的制服......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以问一问，你抱着的是谁吗？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一介战士。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"战士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......她在你身上留下了伤口。她是敌人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是......这伤口，不是会杀死人的伤口。"}]},{"label":"一位同胞。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"她也是感染者......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不是这个意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，你像是失去了什么。"}]},{"label":"一个朋友。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"她是你的朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，朋友......她和你相联系的时间，很短很短。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......我不知道这会不会很快就消失。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你能......感受到什么？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人相互交流的痕迹。气味，温度，形状"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不太清楚，但她......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩将手伸向霜星。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（默许）","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想我这么做吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是。我是外人。我和她没有联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是我能做的事情，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思。"}]},{"label":"（出声阻止）","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你也和阿米娅一样，能读心？","value":"4","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没有，我不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅是特别的。我知道阿米娅的法术......也觉得她很辛苦。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"5","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我想，我不能碰她。我也不能感受她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"她与这片大地的联系和我没有关联。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有......没有理由去触碰她。"}]},{"label":"我没法那么快理解你的反应。","value":"6","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"其他干员，也会这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛上，大家都很有个性......但我可能更奇怪一些。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"抱歉。","value":"7","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，没关系的。我已经习惯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你是要......用这个机器吧？"}]},{"label":"......","value":"8","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"请，请不要生气......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你不说话，我有些......有些不知道该做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你是要......用这个机器吧？"}]},{"label":"对不起，小姑娘。","value":"9","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"比起被别人害怕，我更愿意别人认真对我说话。所以，没问题的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你是要......用这个机器吧？"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果这里确实是感染者最后归宿的话。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我来帮你吧。先让我看一下记录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，没问题，这个舱室已经清理过了。把她放在这个平台上吧。轻一点，嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"之后平台会收进去，然后......等舱门关上，按下这个键就可以了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你很熟悉操作。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，因为我操作过许多遍了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"为什么.......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的感染者，最后都会到这里来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是我认识，我感受过的人，我的队员，我都会自己操作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"原本的使用说明书很复杂，系统简单的操作方式，我都记在终端上了。只要稍稍看看，身体就会熟悉那种感觉。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"什么感觉？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......大概就像链子一样。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"链子......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"说是两个人之间牵着的线也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"送走和你有联系的人，是解开缠在他们身上的线。线的另一边还是系在我们身上，可哪怕没有再系着谁了，线却也垂不下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那种感觉，是身体里有什么消失了的感觉。已经不知道那里是什么，却又知道，他们曾经在，也不会回来。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"为什么要去熟悉这种感觉？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"因为只有熟悉了，才不会突然地痛起来吧？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......你究竟是......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"打扰一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"身在罗德岛生物感染综合处理室的精英干员Rosmontis，你的识别码将在15mins后失效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下来我将为你进行更新，请在原地停留十五秒左右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"另外，接舷区发生了小规模的武装冲突，有条件请在识别码更新后进行支援，以期减少我方资源的损耗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嗯。我知道了，马上就去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我在终端上记一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第六次提示你，如果你愿意向本系统开放权限，系统可以直接将信息发送至......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"这是只有我......只有我能写的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白。请。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"精英干员......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"PRTS指的是我。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我该叫你Rosmontis吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以叫我......迷迭香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......她，叫什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......我想至少知道她的名字。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"霜星。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"好好听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，霜星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......拜拜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
